{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73522","main_id":73522,"main_title":"「当初那位参赛者」","main_description":"又见到了多莉，问问她还有没有别的情报吧…","chapter_title":"「当初那位参赛者」","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7352202,"subquest_title":"关于二十年前那位神秘的参赛者，阿如村似乎有人见过他…","talk_id":7352202,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":735220213,"next_line_ids":[735220214],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":30356,"speaker_text_hash":1514915888,"speaker":"丽什蒂","speaker_raw":"丽什蒂","text_hash":2112319482,"text":"不在啦。不在了…","raw_text":"不在啦。不在了…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7352202.json"}
